+
+## Runtime validation checkout
+
+This local branch compares the complete app under the shared MicroPython and
+Pyodide browser bundle. With the pytincture feature branch and latest dhxpyt
+installed, run:
+
+```sh
+python -m pytincture.browser_build --config pyproject.toml
+python tests/runtime_server.py
+python tests/ui_smoke.py --base-url http://127.0.0.1:8095 --runtime micropython
+python tests/ui_smoke.py --base-url http://127.0.0.1:8095 --runtime pyodide
+python tests/browser_interactions.py
+```
+
+The launcher uses its own database; it does not modify the existing service's
+books. Open `http://127.0.0.1:8095/py_ui?runtime=micropython` with the documented
+demo credentials. The tests cover the real UI and restore edited book records.
